665:`agent_start` fires when a low-level agent run begins. `agent_end` fires when that run ends, but Pi may still auto-retry, auto-compact and retry, or continue with queued follow-up messages. `agent_before_settle` is the final actionable boundary: it can append session entries and request one continuation. `agent_settled` is final and notification-only; use it for status integrations that need to know Pi will not continue running automatically.
